			"Message": "fix(Air): Resolve various bugs and enhance code quality\n\nThis commit addresses several issues across the Air daemon's components and improves overall code reliability.\n\n- **Dependencies**: Added `tokio-stream` and `bytes` crates to support gRPC streaming and byte handling, and reformatted Cargo.toml for better readability.\n- **Authentication**: Fixed a critical decryption bug by creating a mutable copy of cipher data during AES-256-GCM decryption, ensuring data integrity and security. Also fixed the Clone implementation to include the `aead_algo` field.\n- **Downloader**: Specified the chunk type as `bytes::Bytes` for clarity and correctness in network operations, and fixed the Clone implementation by including the `checksum_verifier` field.\n- **Plugins**: Removed the `Debug` derive from `PluginRegistry` to avoid unnecessary trait constraints and potential compilation issues.\n- **gRPC Service**: Added the `Bytes` import for proper handling of byte data in Vine gRPC communications.\n\nThese fixes ensure the continued reliability and security of the Air background daemon, which provides critical services for the Land code editor ecosystem.",
			"SHA": "00f54cb7e6f4d678e9a82ea60efdab91464aa876"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-01-30T09:39:14Z",
			"File": [
				"⣿⠃⠀⠀⠀",
				82,
				21
			],
			"Message": "feat(docs,auth,downloader,grpc,tests): Comprehensive project documentation and core enhancements\n\nThis commit introduces extensive documentation foundations and significant improvements to core Air components, preparing the project for broader contributor engagement and production readiness.\n\nAdded comprehensive documentation structure:\n- CONTRIBUTING.md outlines contribution workflows and expectations\n- README_EXTENDED.md provides developer-focused quickstart and reference\n- API.md details gRPC endpoints, authentication, and client usage\n- CONFIGURATION.md explains configuration options and environment setup\n- CODE_REFERENCE.md documents public APIs and integration patterns\n- DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md covers development practices and testing\n- GRPC.md specifies Vine protocol implementation details\n\nEnhanced security and functionality:\n- Upgraded authentication encryption from XOR to AES-256-GCM using ring crate\n- Added pause/resume capability to downloader with range request support\n- Fixed version comparison logic in update manager (now correctly detects newer versions)\n- Enabled gRPC server with proper lifecycle management and shutdown handling\n- Improved memory measurement in performance tests using sysinfo\n\nTesting infrastructure:\n- Added unit tests for authentication, downloader, indexing, and update components\n- Created common test helpers and mock service reuse structure\n- Added test runner script with coverage support via cargo-tarpaulin\n- Enhanced performance tests with accurate memory measurement\n\nThis foundational work establishes robust documentation, improves security practices, and enhances core service reliability for the Air background daemon.",
			"SHA": "ba46c4d583e4650ed9d9dfb741a8e54233e472df"
		},
